kes you ask?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_04_01_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_04_01_29","text":"It feels to me like Yuni is very dependent on you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_04_01_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"mihara","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_04_01_30","text":"Dependent? Yuni?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_04_01_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"mihara","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_04_01_31","text":"You're way off base. We both rely on each other. We have no choice.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_04_01_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"mihara","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_04_01_32","text":"When two people are together, they're like two gears in perfect sync.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_04_01_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"mihara","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_04_01_33","text":"Yuni and I are crooked gears.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_04_01_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"mihara","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_04_01_34","text":"No one else fits with us.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_04_01_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_04_01_35","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_04_01_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"mihara","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_04_01_36","text":"But sometimes, two crooked gears can be a perfect match.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_04_01_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"mihara","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_04_01_37","text":"That's how I met Yuni. Neither of us is perfect, but we're perfect for each other.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_04_01_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"mihara","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_04_01_38","text":"I realize how strange we must seem to people on the outside looking in.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_04_01_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_04_01_39","text":"No, I didn't.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_04_01_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_04_01_40","text":"It's kind of... sweet.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_04_01_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"mihara","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_04_01_41","text":"... Thank you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_04_01_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_04_01_42","text":"A crooked gear...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_04_01_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"mihara","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_04_01_43","text":"All right, your turn.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_04_01_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_04_01_44","text":"Hmm?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_04_01_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"mihara","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_04_01_45","text":"You've been working with Rapi for a long time, haven't you? I can tell.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_04_01_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"mihara","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_04_01_46","text":"Neon, on the other hand, must be new.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_04_01_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_04_01_47","text":"Well, it's a secret, but I'm actually a spy.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_04_01_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_04_01_48","text":"Yep, a real whopper of a secret.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_04_01_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"mihara","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_04_01_49","text":"Wow, no kidding?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_04_01_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"ani